    s = s & "                  ""Ctrl+Z bilan qaytarish mumkin."" & vbCrLf & vbCrLf & ""Davom etaymi?"", vbYesNo + vbQuestion, ""Adabiyotlar ro'yxati"") <> vbYes Then Exit Sub" & vbCrLf
